multiflexi-semaphore for Debian
------------------------------

MultiFlexi credential prototype for Semaphore UI REST API
(SEMAPHORE_URL + SEMAPHORE_TOKEN). After installation run:

    multiflexi-cli credential-prototype:sync

(the package postinst does this automatically) to register the prototype
in the MultiFlexi database.

